  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AAP 2022: AD6 Conflict Prevention, Peacebuilding and Crisis Preparedness Support Measures</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Conflict Prevention, Peacebuilding and Crisis Preparedness Support Measures will contribute to the research, identification, formulation, evaluation, and implementation of interventions, inter alia providing technical assistance and training, and organising meetings and seminars, bringing relevant stakeholders together, for actions under the thematic area Peace, Stability and Conflict prevention of the NDICI.</narrative>
  </description>
